**** do not use under review *******
<p>Thank you for getting in touch with us regarding our on board Wi-Fi service.</p>

<p><b><i>-If not working add:-</i></b></p>

<p>We understand your disappointment at being unable to use our new service and sincerely regret it wasn’t available on QF{{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}}. When this occurs our cabin crew will explore all avenues to restoring the service, from rebooting the system to contacting engineering teams on the ground for advice, but in some instances no resolution can be implemented prior to arrival back at the aircraft’s next destination.</p>

<p>Feedback from customers like you, is the best way for us to identify areas in need of improvement or development, and has been instrumental in the development of this new service. I would like to assure you your comments have been passed onto our engineering management team.</p>

<p><b><i>-If concerns of safety add:-</i></b></p>

<p>I can assure you that issues of safety are paramount here at Qantas and we would never compromise the safety of our customers and staff. Our in-flight Wi-Fi has been put through its paces, with many hours of ground and in-flight testing and every piece of equipment on the aircraft has to be certified to stringent standards.</p>

<p>Thank you again for taking the time to contact us. I hope we have the opportunity to welcome you on board again and that you will feel comfortable flying with us.</p>
</body>
</html>